 "html": "\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-1 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large is-style-rounded\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large is-style-rounded\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large is-style-rounded\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-2 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-vivid-red-color has-text-color has-link-color has-larger-font-size wp-elements-608af0d8ff001ccf27e43c887cd21329\"><strong></strong></p>\n\n\n\n<pre id=\"tw-target-text\" class=\"wp-block-preformatted\">---   Vintage French Champagne vödör az 1980-as évekből, a világhírű \"BOLLINGER\" champagne háztól. <br>Különleges kiadású regisztrált modell, tervezte: Eric Berthes<br><br>Szálcsiszolt rozsdamentes acélból készült, és fényes függőleges csíkokkal, fekete BOLLINGER felirattal.<br>A belseje piros, és vannak rajta használati nyomok, inkább mint a külsején.<br><br>Nettó tömege 897 gramm.<br>Méretek: 29 cm a magas oldalon, 22 cm alacsony oldalon, átmérője alsó 12 cm.</pre>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-vivid-red-color has-text-color has-link-color has-larger-font-size wp-elements-53b403dd005b1c3977ff41dd36e9bf50\"><strong></strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>Charming 1980’s Vintage French Champagne bucket, ice bucket, wine cooler by the world famous “BOLLINGER” Champagne makers. This is the real deal, an AUTHENTIC BOLLINGER bucket no CHINESE copy!!!!!! Special edition registered model by Eric Berthes. It is made of brushed stainless steel and shiny vertical stripes with BOLLINGER written in Black on it. The inside is red and has signs of use, more so than the outside. Net weight is 897 grams. Dimensions: 29 cm on high side, 22 cm low side, diameter bottom 12 cm. </p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-3 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-larger-font-size\">Champagne Bollinger bárfelszerelések és pezsgős ajándéktárgyak a champagneclub.hu kínálatában. <strong>Nézze meg a többi Bollinger pezsgős jégvedrünket és ajándéktárgyunkat! &gt;&gt;&gt;</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-4 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-right has-larger-font-size\">Champagne Bollinger barware and champagne souvenirs from champagneclub.hu. Check out our other Bollinger champagne ice buckets and souvenirs! &gt;&gt;&gt;</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-5 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-vivid-red-color has-text-color has-link-color has-larger-font-size wp-elements-f41a382dfc7f61bdf7f903c701c8841b\"><strong>VIP BOLLINGER Champagne kóstoló Budapesten maximum 8 főre</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>Érdeklődés és időpont egyeztetés: </p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-6 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-larger-font-size\">Bárfelszerelések tervezése és gyártása Budapesten.                                                    <strong><a href=\"https://sursumvivere.hu/\">www.sursumvivere.hu</a></strong></p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-7 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<p></p>\n",
